The library and playlist records do not expose release dates, so every distinct discovered song must be resolved through the public song-detail API.

```python
library_song_ids = {record['song_id'] for record in song_library_records}
playlist_song_ids = {song['id'] for playlist in playlist_details_by_id.values() for song in playlist['songs']}
all_discovered_song_ids = sorted(library_song_ids | playlist_song_ids)
song_details_by_id = {}
for song_id in all_discovered_song_ids:
    song_details_by_id[song_id] = apis.spotify.show_song(song_id=song_id)
release_year_by_song_id = {song_id: int(str(details['release_date'])[:4]) for song_id, details in song_details_by_id.items()}
print({'distinct_song_count_checked': len(all_discovered_song_ids)})
```

